     "body": "<p>I'm unfamiliar with this class and what the contract is. The proposed fix seems both straightforward and sensible: I would not expect the from and until dates to be derived from the DC values. However, there are various other occurences of the string \"dcmDate\" in this class and I don't know if these also ought to be swapped to mDate.</p>",
